                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>KEY FINDINGS </run>
                  <run fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>- Seasonality gap: Fall ($382K) vs Summer ($225K) = $157K Q3 opportunity  </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>- Central region: negative margin (-11.68%) — discount strategy needs review  </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>- Technology drives highest margins; Furniture Tables sub-category is unprofitable </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>RECOMMENDATION: </run>
                  <run fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='10'>Shift Q3 budget to Technology in West region to close the $157K seasonal gap</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
